<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 400 mln Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     *5.25     MATURITY    29.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  S-15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		*FOR YEARS ONE TO FOUR, 8.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
